(MOCK - Reading a Small Data Table) Tj T*
(SYNTHETIC LOCAL DEMO - NOT INSTITUTIONAL CONTENT OR APPROVAL) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Objective: Identify a primary key and count rows that satisfy a stated equality) Tj T*
(condition in a small table.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(MOCK ORIGINAL LESSON. A table organizes records as rows and attributes as columns. A) Tj T*
(primary key distinguishes each row and must be unique and present. Filtering selects) Tj T*
(matching rows; it does not rewrite the original table.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(WORKED EXAMPLE) Tj T*
(Consider rows \(id=1, subject=computing\), \(id=2, subject=math\), \(id=3,) Tj T*
(subject=computing\), \(id=4, subject=art\). The condition subject = computing selects) Tj T*
(rows 1 and 3, so COUNT\(*\) for that filtered set is 2. The table still has four) Tj T*
(stored rows.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CHECK AND CORRECTION) Tj T*
(Which property is required of the id column when it is the primary key?) Tj T*
(Uniqueness and presence are essential for primary-key identity; the values need not) Tj T*
(be consecutive.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Read a condition one row at a time. Mark matching rows, then count those marks.) Tj T*
(COUNT\(*\) counts matching rows in this example, whereas reading a column value) Tj T*
(reports data from a row. A SELECT filter does not delete nonmatching rows.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(INDEPENDENT APPLICATION) Tj T*
(Rows have subjects computing, math, computing and art. How many satisfy subject =) Tj T*
(computing?) Tj T*
(The first and third rows match. Two matching rows are returned; the stored table is) Tj T*
(unchanged.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(GLOSSARY) Tj T*
(Row: One record in a table.) Tj T*
(Column: A named attribute represented across the rows of a table.) Tj T*
(Primary key: A unique, present column or column set that identifies a row.) Tj T*
(Filter: A condition used to choose matching rows for a query result.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Separate storage from a query result. A key identifies rows, a condition selects) Tj T*
(them, and a count reports how many matched. The original rows remain unchanged by) Tj T*
(this read-only selection.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Original mock fixture. No real learner data, school policy, signatures or) Tj T*
(redistribution review.) Tj T*
